      "name": "Copy Button",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button-ghost",
      "description": "A quiet icon action in command panels.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-ghost\" aria-label=\"Copy command\"><svg width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg></button>",
      "css": ".ds-ghost{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:18px;border-radius:6px;font-family:\"Manrope Variable\",sans-serif;font-size:12px;font-weight:650;border:0;cursor:pointer;transition:background .2s,color .2s,transform .2s;width:36px;height:36px;color:var(--muted,#a4aebe);background:transparent}.ds-ghost:hover{color:var(--foreground,#edf1f7);background:var(--surface-raised,#171e2a)}.ds-ghost:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--accent,#efb98d);outline-offset:5px;}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Service Navigation",
      "kind": "nav",
      "description": "Selects a real terminal capture with supplied AWS icons. Each button keeps its service name as an accessible label and hover title. The preview cycles every two seconds, wraps after Lambda, and has a pause/resume control. Manual selection restarts the timer.",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-tabs\" aria-label=\"Preview an AWS service\"><button aria-label=\"EC2\" title=\"EC2\" aria-pressed=\"true\"><img src=\"/icons/ec2.svg\" width=\"26\" height=\"26\" alt=\"\"/></button><button aria-label=\"S3\" title=\"S3\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><img src=\"/icons/s3.svg\" width=\"26\" height=\"26\" alt=\"\"/></button><button aria-label=\"Lambda\" title=\"Lambda\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><img src=\"/icons/lambda.svg\" width=\"26\" height=\"26\" alt=\"\"/></button></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-tabs {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: stretch;\n  padding: 0 14px;\n  gap: 10px;\n  background: #1b1e2a;\n  min-height: 37px;\n}\n.ds-tabs button {\n  display: inline-flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  min-width: 48px;\n  min-height: 44px;\n  color: #aeb7c8;\n  background: transparent;\n  border: 0;\n  border-bottom: 1px solid transparent;\n  font-family: var(--font-mono);\n  font-size: 10px;\n  padding: 9px 12px;\n}\n.ds-tabs button:hover {\n  color: white;\n  background: #252a3a;\n}\n.ds-tabs button[aria-pressed=\"true\"] {\n  color: var(--accent);\n  border-bottom-color: var(--accent);\n}\n.ds-tabs button:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--accent,#efb98d);outline-offset:5px;}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Command Panel",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "code-block",
      "description": "A bordered command surface with a copy control.",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-code\"><div class=\"ds-code-label\">terminal<button class=\"ds-ghost\" aria-label=\"Copy command\"><svg width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg></button></div><pre>cargo run -- --demo</pre></section>",
      "css": ".ds-ghost{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:18px;border-radius:6px;font-family:\"Manrope Variable\",sans-serif;font-size:12px;font-weight:650;border:0;cursor:pointer;transition:background .2s,color .2s,transform .2s;width:36px;height:36px;color:var(--muted,#a4aebe);background:transparent}.ds-ghost:hover{color:var(--foreground,#edf1f7);background:var(--surface-raised,#171e2a)}.ds-ghost:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--accent,#efb98d);outline-offset:5px;}.ds-code{background:var(--surface,#111620);border:1px solid var(--border,#29313f);border-radius:7px;overflow:hidden}.ds-code-label{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;color:var(--muted,#a4aebe);padding-left:13px;font-family:\"Manrope Variable\",sans-serif;font-size:9px}.ds-code pre{margin:0;padding:3px 14px 15px;overflow-x:auto;font-family:\"JetBrains Mono Variable\",monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:2;color:#cdd7e8}"
